      ],
      "source": "https://plainfieldlibrary.info/OnlineExhibits/ONTHEMOVE/one_1.html",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Plainfield sits along Pennsylvania Route 641, linking it eastward to Carlisle and westward to Newville.",
